# NoEgoDev / NED environment example
# Do not commit a populated .env.

# Daytona is the only V1 compute provider. Prefer an OS secret store or hidden TTY
# input; environment injection is for an already-authorized headless run only.
DAYTONA_API_KEY=<store-backed-secret>

# V1 model access defaults to ChatGPT OAuth through Hermes provider openai-codex.
# NED reuses a safe HERMES_HOME auth store or launches fixed device authorization.
# No OpenRouter or model API key is required in the default journey.
# HERMES_HOME=$HOME/.hermes/profiles/your-profile

# Claude Max, Nous Portal, and GitHub Copilot are optional documented advanced
# provider extension points. Direct API keys, where safely supported, use hidden
# input or a secret store and are never required by the default installer.

# Optional: repository automation credentials belong in an OAuth/CLI credential
# store where possible, not a populated committed .env.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=<store-backed-secret>
